OL,3,ALong queues after power surge at
OL,4,AStansted Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers arriving at Stansted Airport
OL,7,Fhave described waiting in long queues
OL,8,Fto reach immigration control after a
OL,9,Fpower surge shut down its systems.
OL,11,FTraveller Jill Stakem reported the
OL,12,Fairport's internal tram system had
OL,13,Ffailed earlier and people were "being
OL,14,Fheld in a corridor for over 90
OL,15,Fminutes".
OL,17,FStakem added: "It's horrendous. No
OL,18,Fcommunication, no seating for people,
OL,19,Fno-one offering watering."
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
